    "testimonials_KVXiKn": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_YtHXTB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>I've been taking Extrim for a month and I began noticing the effects almost immediately. Within a few days I noticed a decrease in my appetite and within a week I dropped a few pounds and felt detoxified, less lethargic and more energized.</p><p><strong>AJ P.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UKNyEx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>I've had issues with my digestive system my entire life until I started taking DIGESTIVE+++, which helps me become more regular. But ever since I started taking Extrim, the detox and colon cleansing effects were even more pronounced. I feel so much lighter, and I already lost 2 pounds in just a week!</p><p><strong>Linda S.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_hcDgMz": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>I started by taking one extrim shape in the morning before breakfast and it curbed my cravings all day long. After two weeks I no longer felt bloated and dropped down one pant size. I have great energy without the jittery feeling.</p><p><strong>Jeanne C.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_n3J9fX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Since I started taking Extrim, I have noticed a significant boost in my metabolism and a decrease in my cravings, especially for carb heavy meals. This has really helped me manage the weight gain I was previously experiencing. I have even noticed an improvement in my focus and attention at work. Overall, I am very pleased with Extrim - thank you so much!</p><p><strong>Ken M.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LP7iNY": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>When it comes to weight management, I understand the basics. I don’t overindulge in unhealthy foods, and exercise regularly. However, in the course of work and life, sometimes we can’t be as strict as we would like when it comes weight management. I might be traveling in hotels where there is no gym, or have to go on work meetings where I can’t pick the foods I eat. This is when Extrim shape has really helped me when I can’t stay on track. It’s ok if I miss one workout or if I have a few cheat meals a week. The combined three in one benefits in Extrim helps me stay the course on my weight management journey!</p><p><strong>Winston S.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_8gpLtY": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Both my wife and I have experienced two benefits, first a noticeable decrease in appetite resulting in smaller meals and/or in less frequent meals. The second benefit we both have noticed (or maybe not noticed, which made my wife pretty happy) also is that neither of us have experienced any jitters or erratic energy peaks as with other weight-loss pills we have tried. Instead, we have experienced a smooth, mild and long-lasting sort of energy after taking Extrim.</p><p><strong>Armando R.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
